  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Microsoft SQL Server — the industry-leading enterprise relational database. Stores OASIS holons and avatars using ADO.NET with indexed lookup columns and full JSON serialisation. Compatible with SQL Server 2016+ and Azure SQL. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
